.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-DEFAULTAPPS 1
.Os 1.6.2

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-defaultapps
.Nd configure default applications and file associations.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
The Basic Settings tab sets the default web browser, e-mail client, file
manager and virtual terminal.
The Advanced tab lists MIME types by group and sets the default application
for each, either from an installed application or from an arbitrary binary.
.Pp
These defaults are used by
.Xr lumina-open 1
when opening files and URLs.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-defaultapps
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-mimeapps.list
Per-user default application for each MIME type.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lumina-open 1

